                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "balibatamike, akusalala, akukutauka kabotu mumaanda aabo, kabasamauka, akumvwa balumi babo, kuti makani aa-Leza atasampaulwi.",
          "type": "text",
